  title: Promotion Day
  character: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8db74389b8c31914dbe8c9c4cf3c818b, type: 2}
  mailText: "Hello dear employee\n\nToday is promotion monday! You are free to put
    the most deserving employees report in the<b> <color=red>formation </b></color>
    drawer. However they need to respect the minimum grade requirement.\n\n<size=30>Requierment
    as a junior:</size>\n\nHealth grading :\n- At least 3 A's \n- 2 E's maximum \n\n<size=30>Requirement
    for manager :</size>\nHealth grading :\n\n- At least 3 A's \n- 1 E maximum \n
    \nyou can check if the employe is a manager on the Database!\n"
